      "text": "The faydhaan gives another willing creature a magical gift or an agreeable conversation. The creature gains a +2 status bonus to Society and Diplomacy checks. A creature can't have more than one gift at a time, and a faydhaan can't grant more than one gift at a time.\n\nThe gift ends if the target acts hostile, or if the faydhaan renounces the recipient (a single action).\n\nEffect: Gift of Hospitality"
